Diagrams directory — store system and data flow diagrams here.

Suggested tools:
  - draw.io (free, exports to PNG/SVG)
  - Lucidchart
  - Mermaid (inline in Markdown docs)
  - dbdiagram.io (for entity-relationship diagrams)

Recommended diagrams to create:
  1. pipeline_architecture.png   — End-to-end ETL flow diagram
  2. database_erd.png            — Entity-Relationship Diagram (PostgreSQL tables)
  3. deployment_architecture.png — Infrastructure diagram (Docker, AWS)
